WEBVTT

00:13.982 --> 00:18.565
He's not angry, he's overwhelmed

00:21.147 --> 00:29.333
I see the signs, I know this pain The static

00:29.433 --> 00:36.078
flooding in your brain It's not a choice, it's

00:36.158 --> 00:40.981
not a fight It's not a flaw, it's just the world

00:41.482 --> 00:42.923
and all it's wrong

00:48.975 --> 00:53.078
Aubrey,

00:53.138 --> 00:57.260
my name

00:58.541 --> 00:59.101
is Aubrey.

01:18.621 --> 01:21.023
Is it okay if I put my hand on your shoulder?

01:23.704 --> 01:27.227
Is it okay if I hug you?

01:52.146 --> 01:52.586
I

02:00.852 --> 02:08.738
know you're not alone The storm is past, you're

02:08.858 --> 02:10.840
safe, you're home

02:14.163 --> 02:20.207
All the first unconditional, the first real hug

02:21.888 --> 02:22.689
You're safe

02:26.952 --> 02:27.692
You're safe

02:35.517 --> 02:36.258
You're safe

